1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1830 Birth 1830 Gert Petrus Joachim Van Der Merwe (Senior) gebore 1840 en is in 1922 met die dood van sy seun word dit aangewys dat hy oolede is op die ouderdom van 92 jaar, wat teenstrydig is omtrent sy geboorte. 
2 CONC Hy moes dan gebore gewees het in 1830 volgens sy seun Gert Petrus Joachim se sterfkennis in 1922 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anecdote CLAIMS FOR COMPENSATION. BURGHERS. BOSHOF. GERT PETRUS JOACHIM VAN DER MERWE (SENIOR). dated 1903, which made gert (senior) 63 still working on the mines. CJC 1376 646 Marriage to: Aletta Susanna Van Der Merwe (born JANSE
2 CONC N VAN RENSBURG) https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/KZL3-LDH Bloemfontein 1871 Age ‎~41‏ Birth of son: Karel Erasmus Van Der Merwe Sep 17 1871 1880 Age ‎~50‏ Birth of son: Gert Petrus Joachim Van Der Merwe, B3C9D4E6F3G8H5 Vrysta
2 CONC atse Boer plaas Sep 1880 Lewe 42 jaar en 5 maande Fact 1: Aletta Susanna Van Der Merwe (born JANSEN VAN RENSBURG) CO 490 7/245 LUNATIC GERT PETRUS JOACHIM VAN DER MERWE. 1911. It can only be hims as his son stll works in the mines
2 CONC . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dauphina Johanna v d Merwe mentioned him as still alive in Boshoff in 1922 on death notice of her son, but heritage info shows that he dies in 1920 Fact 3: Aletta Susanna Van Der Merwe (born JANSEN VAN RENSBURG) DEPOT VAB SOURCE H
2 CONC G TYPE LEER VOLUME_NO 7/5/1/13 SYSTEM 01 REFERENCE 21/1911 PART 1 DESCRIPTION ADMINISTRATION OF JUSTICE. LUNATIC. PATIENT. GERT PETRUS JOACHIM VAN DER MERWE. STARTING 19110000 ENDING 19110000 REMARKS BOSHOF. 1901 Death of wife: Al
2 CONC etta Susanna Van Der Merwe (born JANSEN VAN RENSBURG) After 1901 Somewhere there is info that she passed away at Knapdaar, May 30 ,1859, but she had children and a family and was reporterd to be at Kimberley RC arriving there on J
2 CONC ul 6 1901.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Aletta Susanna leef nog met registrasie in die konsentrasie kamp. Sy kon dus nie gesterwe het in 1859 nie, haar twee seuns op my stamboom was toe nog nie eens gebore nie. Sy sterf dus na 1901. 1904 Age ‎~74‏ Marriage of son: Gert
2 CONC  Petrus Joachim Van Der Merwe, B3C9D4E6F3G8H5 Spouse: Martha Susanna (eerste Vrou) Van Der Merwe (born PELSER) Circa 1904 1911 Age ‎~81‏ Marriage of son: Gert Petrus Joachim Van Der Merwe, B3C9D4E6F3G8H5 Spouse: Dauphina Johanna P
2 CONC etronella (Tweede Vrou) xxBrits x Van der Merwe, A1B6C3D2E7F1G1H8 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gert Petrus Joachim se eerste vrou is oorlede 23/4/1910 met die geboorte van haar vierde kind Caral Erasmus van der Merwe. Hy en Dolphina trou in 1911 to sy 17 jaar oud was en het haar eerste kind Aletta Susanna op Jan 9 1912 geha
2 CONC d toe sy 18 jaar oud was. Johannesburg, Transvaal, Suid Africa 1911 1920 Age 89-90 Death 1920 Lived for 82 years
2 CONT ----
