1 TITL Vldknt.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:6242-VPRG?lang=en Baptism]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Probate 15 January 1829: https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSSQ-MQDC-Z?i=92&cc=2517051
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Veld-cornet Gerrit Snyman's Place'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Latitude 32° 46′ 45″ S. Longitude 21 1 10 E.
2 CONT
2 CONT The above Engraving (see profile picture) is a view of Snyman's habitation, looking southward. It will give a just idea of the dwellings of the Boer in the Karoo, and also '''in the Roggeveld''', few being there much larger or mor
2 CONC e convenient. The mountains are a continuation to the eastward of the same ridge, of which the Windheuvel forms a part, and is situated at a little distance to the right, out of the picture. The scene here represented, is that of 
2 CONC the flocks going out to pasture early in the morning. The shepherds, who are seldom of any other race than Hottentots, are always armed with a gun, as a defense against either the wild beasts, or the Bushmen, who, frequently conce
2 CONC aling themselves behind the rocks or the bushes, suddenly attack the shepherd, and carry off the flock. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://darwin-online.org.uk/content/frameset?pageseq=1&itemID=A751.01&viewtype=text
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''b7c4d7 Gerrit Snyman''' (*c.1767) (≈15.02.1767 Paarl)
2 CONT
2 CONT Word aangeteken as '''Gert Snyman de Oude''' in boedel verwysing MOOC 7/1/107 (36). Gert Snyman de Oude en Catharina Elisabeth Scholtz word in boedel dokument op 23.04.1826 as woonagtig '''de Koude Bokkeveld''' bevestig.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sterfkennis: 15.01.1829 op 62 jaar, Worcester distrik – Sterftekennis in Kaap Kolonie Register, National Archives, Cape Town. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Boedel dokumente:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerrit het twee boedels laat registreer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Boedel MOOC 7/1/86 (116) is op 22.05.1822 deur Gert Snyman en '''Sara Maria Schoeman''' ‘beyde van deezen uithoeks geboortig, en aan de Olyphants Rivier/ distrik George/ woonagtig’ geteken terwyl in die lys van boedels word die bo
2 CONC edel vir Gert Snyman op '''26.12.1821''' aangeteken. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Boedel MOOC 7/1/107 (36) is op 08.05.1815 in die Worcester distrik deur ''fung. secretaris'' van Tulbagh, Heer Frederik van de Graaffen geskryf en in die lys van boedels vir Gert Snyman as '''23.04.1826''' aangeteken en deur notar
2 CONC ius Philippus Johannes Poggenpoel geregistreer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eerste huwelik: 28-03-1790 te Graaff-Reinet met Sara Maria Schoeman (*c.1772) (≈25.12.1772 Graaff-Reinet) Her siblings were all baptized in Tulbagh & married in Cape Town (†08.06.1806) dogter van Johannes Hendrik Schoeman en Petro
2 CONC nella Bekker {b4c5} (≈19.02.1741).
2 CONT
2 CONT Tweede huwelik: 08.06.1806 met Catharina Elizabeth Sophia Scholtz {b2c7d3} (*13.09.1789 Roggeveld, Tulbagh) (=31.01.1790) (†12.10.1870 ‘Modderfontein’, Tafelberg, Koue Bokkeveld) dogter van Joachim Scholtz {b2c7} en Catharina Eliz
2 CONC abeth van der Merwe {b3c3d5e4} (=25.12.1766 Tulbagh). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Inligting verskaf deur Alexander Armenis
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
