1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''c5 Johannes Jacobus''' gedoop: 11 Jan 1728, burger Stellenbosch, getroud: Johanna Cloete
2 CONT
2 CONT '''d6 Maria Jacoba''' gedoop: 4 Jul 1762, getroud: N. van der Walt
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Probate Record: https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSQF-X91R-N?mode=g&i=1233&cat=331262
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Birth: The birth was registered at NGK Malmesbury (Swartland) on 4/07/1762 to Jan Koetze / Anna Kloete and witnessed by Jacobus Koetze / Maria Kloete
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSKD-LQ7N-G?cat=993684%3Bi%3D3&i=10&cc=1478678
2 CONT
2 CONT Film: Film # 008147789, Image 11, Page 45.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Marriage: 
2 CONT 1)Marriage to Nicolaas van der Walt registered at Tulbagh (Roodezand) NGK on 13th September, 1878.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSV8-69VB-X?cat=993682%3Bi%3D445&i=111&cc=1478678
2 CONT
2 CONT Film # 008121005, Image: 112, Item 24.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Marriage to Stephanus Johannes Venter recorded at NGK Graaff Reinet, Cape Colony on 17th February, 1813.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSV8-QDYL?cat=959223%3Bi%3D52&i=70&cc=1478678
2 CONT
2 CONT Film # 008121025, Image 71.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Death: Maria is recorded as having died at the Field Cornetcy of Groote Fontein, Rhenosterberg, Cape Colony (near Middelburg, Cape) on 29th September, 1849 at the age of 87.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSQX-MSY3-6?cat=331262&i=1808&cc=2517051
2 CONT
2 CONT Film # 007844937, Image 1809
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of: Johannes Jacobus Coetzee, b5c5 and Johanna Margretha Cloete
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of:          Nicolaas (Klaas) van der Walt, a1b8 and Stephanus Johannes Venter, b5c1d9
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of:      Johanna Margaretha Van der Walt; Andries Johannes van der Walt, b8c2; Anna Martha Olivier, 
2 CONT                         b8c3; Hester Jacoba Kruger, b8c4; Johannes Lodewicus van der Walt, b8c5; Nicolaas van der 
2 CONT                         Walt b8c6; Anna Maria du Plessis, b8c7; Elizabeth Johanna van der Walt, b8c8;                           
2 CONT                         Renche Johanna van der Walt, b8c9; Susanna Sophia Coetzee, b8c10 and Hendrik Tjaart   
2 CONT                        Jacobus van der Walt, b8c11
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of:       Gerhardus (Gerrit) Coetzee, b5c5d2; Huibrecht Coetzee, b5c5d3; Johannes Coetzee, b5c5d4; 
2 CONT                        Anna Elizabeth Coetzee, b5c5d1; Margaretha Johanna Coetzee; Maarten Petrus Albertus Coetzee,
2 CONT                        b5c5d7; Francina Anna Buys, b5c5d8; Anna Elizabeth Coetzee, b5c5d9; Johanna Adriana 
2 CONT                        Catharina Coetzee, b5c5d10; Dirk Jacobus Coetzee, b5c5d11 and Abraham Jacobus Coetzee,
2 CONT                        b5c5d12 
2 CONT
2 CONT NB.                 Maria Jacoba Coetzee's brother Maarten Petrus Albertus Coetzee, b5c5d7, is father of Johannes 
2 CONT                         Christiaan Coetzee, b5c5 (wife Susanna Elizabeth Cornelia Coetzee), who is father of Susanna
2 CONT                         Alida Cornelia Coetzee (wife of Johannes Lodewyk Van Der Walt -1837, mother of Susanna 
2 CONT                         Elizabeth Cornelia van der Walt (Kruger) ).
2 CONT
2 CONT                         She is also sister to Francina Anna Buys (Coetzee), b5c5d8 who is grandmother to Bernardus
2 CONT                         Rudolph Buys, b4c4d1e4 (of Krompoort where the Krugers also resided) who was married to Jan
2 CONT                         Harmse Kruger's sister Hilletje Maria Sophia Fransina Kruger (Pelser/Buys) and two of     
2 CONT                         whose daughters married Nicolaas Barend Marthinus Kruger's brothers.
2 CONT
2 CONT                         Maria married again to Stephanus Venter in Graaff-Reinet on 21.2.1813 (son of Jan Hendrik Venter
2 CONT                         and Johanna Maria Buys 1755-1832. Stephanus Venter was previously married to Francina 
2 CONT                         Johanna Susanna Kruger and their 28 year marriage produced 12 children.
