1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Probate Record: https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSQF-X91R-N?mode=g&i=1233&cat=331262
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 1)Birth: Baptism registered at Cape Town on 13th February, 1757.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HY-DZN4-7TN?i=1&cc=1478678 Image 2.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Marriage: Nicolaas to  Maria Coetzee registered on 13th September, 1778 at Tulbagh, Cape Colony.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSV8-69VB-X?i=111&cat=993682 Image 112. Item 24.
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Gaele Andriesz van der Walt (A) and Johanna Weyers, b3 SM
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife:             Maria Jacoba Coetzee, b5c5d6
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:      Johanna Margaretha Van der Walt; Andries Johannes van der Walt, b8c2; Anna Martha Olivier, b8c3;
2 CONT                        Hester Jacoba Kruger, b8c4; Johannes Lodewicus van der Walt, b8c5; Nicolaas van der Walt b8c6;
2 CONT                        Anna Maria du Plessis, b8c7; Elizabeth Johanna van der Walt, b8c8; Renche Johanna van der
2 CONT                        Walt, b8c9;Susanna Sophia Coetzee, b8c10 and Hendrik Tjaart Jacobus van der Walt, b8c11
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of :    Andries van der Walt, a1b1; Hendrik van der Walt a1b2; Renske Olivier, a1b3; Tjaart van der Walt 
2 CONT                        (B4); Johannes Petrus van der Walt, a1b5; Anna Maria van der Walt, a1b6; Johanna Catharina 
2 CONT                        Venter, a1b7 and Mickael Van der Walt 
2 CONT
2 CONT Half brother of :                   Johanna Sophia Lessing, b1; Johannes Christiaan Lessing b3; Johanna Elisabeth du Preez, b2
2 CONT                         and Johanna Margaretha Lessing, b4 Occupation: 	 Farmer
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes :           Nicolaas was baptised with the name Klaas in Cape Town on 13/2/1757 (witnessed by brother 
2 CONT                         Andries and sister Renske). Nicolaas' father died in his first few months, and he thus grew up on
2 CONT                         the Farm Uitkyk with his mothers second marriage to Christiaan Gottlieb Lessing 1724 - 1788
2 CONT                         (63) from Kamenz, Dresden, Saxony, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT                         Nicolaas was 21 and Maria 16 when they married in 13/9/1778 in Tulbagh, Western Cape and 
2 CONT                         lived in the Renosterberg (north of De Aar) /Middelburg areas. Farms owned were Seekooigat S.W.
2 CONT                         of Steynsburg, Driefonteijnen (the site of Middelburg),De Keur and Vergund S.E of Steynsburg in
2 CONT                        1785. Other farms were De Groote Valleij, Geelhoutboom, Buffelsfontein,Mistkraal,Buffelsvalleij,
2 CONT                         Tafelberg and in 1790 Grootfontein just outside Middelburg where his wife Maria died.
2 CONT                         They were married for 32 years and had 107 grandchildren!
