1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1)Birth : Registered at Paarl (Drakenstein) on 30th November, 1788 and the birth date recorded as 20th April, 1788. Witnesses were Johannes Lodewyk Olivier and Johannes van der Merwe. Johannes Lodewyk's  Death Noti
2 CONC ce gives his birth place as Cradock, Eastern Cape.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSV8-W9WG-P?i=679&cat=993681 Page 680.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2)Marriage 1: Johannes married 14 year old Hester in 30/03/1807 in Graaf Reinet. He was 19. Hester died in 1828.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSV8-QDT7?i=56&cat=959223 Page 57.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3)Marriage 2: Francina Hendrina Magdalena Venter. Francina (second marriage) married Johannes Lodewicus at Cradock on 7/3/1830 when he was 41 and Francina 29. Francina's prior marriage was to Johannes Hendrik van der Walt.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4)Death Notice: 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSQF-X91R-N?mode=g&i=1233&cat=331262
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes Lodewicus van der Walt, b8c5 Also Known As: "Lodewyk" Birthdate: 	      April 20, 1788 (74) Birthplace: 	      Cradock, Eastern Cape, South Africa Death: 	              December 2, 1862 (74) "Klipheuwel", Dist Albert, Sou
2 CONC th Africa 	
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Nicolaas (Klaas) van der Walt, a1b8 and Maria Jacoba Coetzee, b5c5d6
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife 1: Hester Aletta Vorster, b3c1d13
2 CONT
2 CONT Children :  Levina Catharina Van der Walt b8c5d1; Nicolaas van der Walt (b8c5d2); Barend Johannes van der Walt, b8c5d3; Hester Aletta Sophia Susanna  Venter,b8c5d5; Anna Sophia Johanna Margaretha van der Walt, b8c5d6; Andries Joha
2 CONC nnes van der Walt, b8c5d7; Johanna Lodevica Hendrica van der Walt (b 1823) (per R. J. Du Preez  comment on Nicolaas van der Walt - KAB MOOC 13/1/205 Verw. 4.); Louis Stephanus  van der Walt-b8c5d8; Maria Jacoba Steenkamp, b8c5d4; 
2 CONC Barend van der Walt, Johannes Lodewyk van der Walt, Huibrecht Catharina Magdalena married to Douw Gerbrand Steenkamp)
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife 2 : Francina Hendrina Magdalena Venter
2 CONT
2 CONT Children : Herbrecht Catharina Magdalena van der Walt, b8c5d10; Johannes Lodewyk van der Walt, b8c5d9 and Andries van der Walt.          
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of : Johanna Margaretha Van der Walt; Andries Johannes van der Walt, b8c2; Anna Martha Olivier, b8c3; Hester Jacoba Kruger, b8c4; Nicolaas van der Walt b8c6; Anna Maria du Plessis, b8c7;  Elizabeth Johanna van der Walt, b8
2 CONC c8; Renche Johanna van der Walt, b8c9; Susanna Sophia Coetzee, b8c10 and Hendrik Tjaart Jacobus van der Walt, b8c11
2 CONT
2 CONT Occupation:  Farmer.  Johannes Lodewicus Snr. lived and farmed in the Graaf Reinet / Middelburg /Cradock areas. Farm names were Klipheuvel, Middelburg district  and Skoongesig in the Cradock area.
2 CONT --------------------
