1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The birth order is given as it is written in both Philippus Arnoldus and Johanna Susanna Nienaber's estate files of 1884 and 1888 respectively. At the time of their deaths there were only 10 surviving children: Mar
2 CONC ia Jacoba, Jacobus, Philippus Arnoldus, Gabriel Jacobus Cornelius, Sarel Petrus Albertus, Petrus Albertus Daniel Erasmus, Jan Hendrik Johannes, Johannes Andries, Johanna Susanna and Martha Louisa who was still a minor at the time.
2 CONC  The first daughter was named after their mother's mother, the first son after the father's father, the second son after the mother's father, and the third son after the father himself.
