1 NOTE {geni:about_me} = Baptism =
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HY-DZN4-WSS?i=134&cc=1478678 Cape Town Baptism Record] for siblings Johan Adam and Anna Hester. The mother is "Regina Margaretha van de Caap".
2 CONT
2 CONT Also refer notes below.
2 CONT
2 CONT = Marriage =
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSFQ-SRNM?i=119&cat=993508 Neethling - Pieterse Marriage Record (Cape Town)] (2nd from top on right-hand page)
2 CONT
2 CONT = Death Notice =
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Notice: [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSQF-6RFZ?i=587&cat=331262 KAB MOOC 6/9/32 7129 (1844)]
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Seeing that his father died in the year 1774, he could certainly not have been born in the year 1778 (i.e. when he was baptised.)
2 CONT
2 CONT His Death Notice gives his Date of Death as 12 Jan 1844 and states that he was circa 75 years of age when he died. This implies that his Date of Birth was circa 1769.
2 CONT
2 CONT Based on the above, I have taken 1769 as his correct year of birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was thus baptised at the age of 9 (approximately.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Perhaps, seeing that he was a child born outside of wedlock, such a delay might have been understandable?
2 CONT
2 CONT - Nico Conradie (26 Nov 2015)
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT His Death Notice lists these 10 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT (with their corresponding numbering as per GISA's SAG CD Vol. 6)
2 CONT
2 CONT Carolina Margaretha (c1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Johanna Christina (c4)
2 CONT
2 CONT Swerus Jacob (c3)
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Adam (c2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Petrus Johannes Nicolaas (c6)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ernst Jacob (c5)
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Johanna (c7)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jan Christiaan (c8) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Carolina Petronella - not listed in SAG Vol 6
2 CONT
2 CONT Swerus Marthinus Neethling (c9) 
2 CONT
