2 CONT "South Africa, Cape Province, Probate Records of the Master of the High Court, 1834-1989," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSQJ-6HNM?cc=2517051&w... : 27 April 2020), 007844934 > im
