1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1840 https://www.digitalarkivet.no/view/327/pv00000000800314
2 CONT
2 CONT Sist i desember 1847 forlot Poul sitt hjem og reiste til Kristiania. 3/1 1848 forlot han Kristiania, 12/1 1848 er hans bopel ukjent. Han har siden utvandret til U.S.A.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1857 settled in Texas and returned to Norway in 1867 in order to promote immigration from Norway to Texas. As a result 115 Norwegians from Hedmark left Oslo in April of 1868 on the ship "Atalanta", arriving in Galveston, Texas 50 
2 CONC days later.
