2 CONT A large group of passengers from Stange, Hedmark, Norway (organized by Poul Poulson) left Christiania (Oslo) on 4 April, 1868 aboard the ship "Atlanta", arriving in Galveston, Texas, USA on 27 May, 1868.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.norwayheritage.com/p_list.asp?jo=168
2 CONT
2 CONT Among the passengers were, Arne Paulsen Hensøe (49yrs), Marthe Andersdatter (44yrs), Knud Arnesen (17yrs), Kirstine Arnesen (12yrs), Anton Arnesen (9yrs) & Anders Arnesen (7yrs).
2 CONT
2 CONT 1870 census Ordinar Paulson, Martha Paulson, Knud Paulson, Catherine Paulson, Anton Paulson & Ernest Paulson are livng in Texas, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1880 census widow, Martha Polson, Knud Polson, Anders Polson, Anthon Polson & Katie Polson are living at Waco, McLennan County, Texas, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1900 census widow, Martha Paulson, Knud Paulson, Kirstie Paulson & Anthony Paulson are living at Waco city Ward 4, McLennan County, Texas, United States.
