1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NOTE: There were 2 young Anne Olsdatter at Brauter in the early 1790's.  One was born 1774 (konf.1791, g.1807) and datter to Ole Olsen Brauter d.e.  The other Anne Olsdatter Brauter, born 1793 and datter to Ole Ols
2 CONC en Brauter d.y.--- this is the profile for Anne Olsdatter d.y. (f.1793 Brauter)
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Olsdatter d.y. Brauter was born to Ole Olsen (f~1772) og Kari Olsdtr (f~1772).  In 1801 we see them at hus#3 and 2 datters (Anne 7, Kari 4).  It was thought that Anne Olsdtr d.e. Brauter might be datter to Ole Arrnesen Breen,
2 CONC  but we see now that this was his datter Anne; https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Breen/6000000052611593870?through=6000000200229456824 (f.1785 Bingen u. Breen)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Brandval boka, s.150, Brauter: https://www.nb.no/items/2edb3adc2694a6e241d36ef571809468?page=153&searchText=Ole
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1801 FT for Brøter: https://www.digitalarkivet.no/census/person/pf01058241003415
2 CONT ** hus#2: Ole Olsen (56aar), g1g [bygebok notes he was far til Ole Olsen i hus#3]
2 CONT ** kone: Anne Pedersdatter (58aar), g1g [sk.1802 --- 8 barn]
2 CONT ** 3 barn: Olea (23), Peder (16), Inger (13)
2 CONT ** [NOTE: Ole and Anne could easily have had a datter Anne that had moved elsewhere]
2 CONT ** hus#3 HF: Ole Olsen (29aar), g1g
2 CONT ** kone: Kari Olsdtr (29aar), g1g
2 CONT ** 2 dat.: '''Anne (8)''', Kari (4)
